    <informations>Shelly Dimmer 0/1-10V PM Gen4 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: − + S2 O S1 L N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-dimmer-0-1-10v-pm-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_fe00cb30a27d3d263ad7716540a18c3b611131182e28d4ba0098a3c828334093/%7BB28EDF5D-F191-4731-A195-359CB5A48428%7D-20250818-221307.png?cb=1c40ff26111afce54aad6c0d2618fb5e
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_9feb05bbf5da840c9edae4f3718e1495a75004cbc5cb61bf348e0989e5f6725b/0_1-10V-Dimmer-gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=6d3196c11f90e3b2dff1112731c3edca
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_85cc891d93d31508344d86acf81187f4102482342b2eb5516e39ad6a7cfce62c/Shelly%20Dimmer%2001-10V%20PM%20Gen4%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=718a10ae54936d536d5568a5f84030a8

Notes:
- Seven actual screws occupying8pitch positions; blank pitch2 between isolated0/1-10V pair and mains block.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
